# A topic is a directory (2026-09-11). Its product is tracked — topic.json,
# evidence.json, icon.md, review.md — and its process is not. Drawing the line
# inside the topic directory is what keeps an untracked sweep from swallowing
# something load-bearing, the way the claim ledger nearly went with runs/.
research/topics/*/run/
research/topics/*/renders/
research/topics/*/candidates/

# Archived pipeline runs (large: fetched sources, journals)
research/runs/
